    "closure": "the aligned positive unramified fixed-moving same allocation has q-slice survivors but none satisfy the full colored quotient identities over the deployed field",
    "statement": "Normalize J_0={2,1/2,b,1/b} and q(T)=T^2+tT+p in the aligned positive unramified fixed-moving same allocation. The common projection support consists of open factors, the forbidden linear component 4p+5t+4, and one reciprocal quartic. The direct affine minor-conic norm has degree 472 and 28 irreducible factors. Exact deployed-field replay gives 20 endpoint candidates: 12 boundary, four empty, and four base-field q-slice points. All four reproduce the q-slice but fail both full colored quotient norm identities. The two off-common combinations give seven distinct endpoints, all boundary. Hence fixed-same is excluded; fixed-swap and fixed-mixed remain open.",
